</div> <div class="feature-card__content" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <h3 class="feature-card__title" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Fitness Chart</h3> <p class="feature-card__description" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Track your long-term fitness progression with the classic Performance Management Chart. Download historical data from Strava, Garmin, and more to see your complete training history. Automatic eFTP estimation from single maximal efforts keeps your zones up to date.</p> <span class="feature-card__cta" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Learn more &rarr;</span> </div> </a><a href="/features/multisport/" class="feature-card" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <div class="feature-card__image" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <picture data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true"> <source srcset="/_astro/multisport.CNI7khbC_Uezl1.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="/_astro/multisport.CNI7khbC_1i0YHH.webp" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/_astro/multisport.CNI7khbC_Z160IRG.jpg" type="image/jpeg">  <img src="/_astro/multisport.CNI7khbC_ZcxIVg.png" alt="Multisport settings showing separate zones for cycling, running and swimming" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true" decoding="async" width="1784" height="1068"> </picture> </div> <div class="feature-card__content" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <h3 class="feature-card__title" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Multisport</h3> <p class="feature-card__description" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Separate zones and settings per sport. Whether you ride, run, swim, row or do all four, Intervals.icu tracks each discipline independently with appropriate metrics and calculations.</p> <span class="feature-card__cta" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Learn more &rarr;</span> </div> </a><a href="/features/power-curve/" class="feature-card" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <div class="feature-card__image" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <picture data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true"> <source srcset="/_astro/power_curve.BvXKFhNR_Z1Ym9Wp.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="/_astro/power_curve.BvXKFhNR_2hwPny.webp" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/_astro/power_curve.BvXKFhNR_yKzi5.jpg" type="image/jpeg">  <img src="/_astro/power_curve.BvXKFhNR_Z1GyJqe.png" alt="Power duration curve chart comparing multiple seasons" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true" decoding="async" width="1436" height="888"> </picture> </div> <div class="feature-card__content" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <h3 class="feature-card__title" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Power Curve</h3> <p class="feature-card__description" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Compare your power curve across seasons, view watts per kilogram, and estimate your MAP. Multiple modelling algorithms including eFTP, Morton&#39;s 3P, and Monod &amp; Scherrer help you understand your strengths.</p> <span class="feature-card__cta" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Learn more &rarr;</span> </div> </a> </div> <a href="/features/track/" class="see-all" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
