</a> </div>  </div> </section><section class="section section--default" data-astro-cid-sh445jdo> <div class="section-inner" data-astro-cid-sh445jdo>  <div class="category-section" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="category-header" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Plan Your Training</h2> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Build workouts, create training plans, and schedule your season with drag-and-drop ease.</p> </div> <div class="feature-grid" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/features/custom-zones/" class="feature-card" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <div class="feature-card__image" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <picture data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true"> <source srcset="/_astro/custom_zones.Daop1EXY_2fR7oA.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="/_astro/custom_zones.Daop1EXY_2IyHU.webp" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/_astro/custom_zones.Daop1EXY_Z1XxEBO.jpg" type="image/jpeg">  <img src="/_astro/custom_zones.Daop1EXY_1E67xN.png" alt="Custom zone configuration showing user-defined training zones" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true" decoding="async" width="1032" height="1082"> </picture> </div> <div class="feature-card__content" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <h3 class="feature-card__title" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Custom Zones</h3> <p class="feature-card__description" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Create zones for any activity stream, not just power, HR, and pace. Anchor zones to FTP, LTHR, or your own custom fields. Use custom zones for workout prescription, time-in-zone analysis, and tracking zone changes over time.</p> <span class="feature-card__cta" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Learn more &rarr;</span> </div> </a><a href="/features/training-calendar/" class="feature-card" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <div class="feature-card__image" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <picture data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true"> <source srcset="/_astro/calendar_options.Cmjrl_u__sI2AL.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="/_astro/calendar_options.Cmjrl_u__2aoX5n.webp" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/_astro/calendar_options.Cmjrl_u__2vVh5o.jpg" type="image/jpeg">  <img src="/_astro/calendar_options.Cmjrl_u__T0T46.png" alt="Training calendar with planned workouts and completed activities" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true" decoding="async" width="1484" height="908"> </picture> </div> <div class="feature-card__content" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <h3 class="feature-card__title" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Training Calendar</h3> <p class="feature-card__description" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Plan your training with a drag-and-drop calendar. Import from third-party calendars, manage your workout library, sync to many devices and platforms, and track weekly totals.</p> <span class="feature-card__cta" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Learn more &rarr;</span> </div> </a><a href="/features/workout-builder/" class="feature-card" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <div class="feature-card__image" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <picture data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true"> <source srcset="/_astro/workout_builder.D9pPN9qI_14vIDp.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="/_astro/workout_builder.D9pPN9qI_Z2am9j4.webp" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/_astro/workout_builder.D9pPN9qI_Z1okLVq.jpg" type="image/jpeg">  <img src="/_astro/workout_builder.D9pPN9qI_ZO02pe.png" alt="Workout builder interface showing structured workout steps" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true" decoding="async" width="1378" height="1166"> </picture> </div> <div class="feature-card__content" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <h3 class="feature-card__title" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Workout Builder</h3> <p class="feature-card__description" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Create structured workouts with custom steps targeting power, heart rate, pace, or cadence. Import and export Zwift (ZWO), FIT, MRC, and ERG formats. Sync to devices. Easy to use, quick and text based.</p> <span class="feature-card__cta" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Learn more &rarr;</span> </div> </a> </div> <a href="/features/plan/" class="see-all" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
