</a> </div>  </div> </section><section class="section section--alt" data-astro-cid-sh445jdo> <div class="section-inner" data-astro-cid-sh445jdo>  <div class="category-section" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="category-header" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Communicate</h2> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Connect with coaches and athletes. Share workouts, chat, and collaborate.</p> </div> <div class="feature-grid" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <a href="/features/chat/" class="feature-card" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <div class="feature-card__image" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <picture data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true"> <source srcset="/_astro/chat.DPasLlho_ZgekVT.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="/_astro/chat.DPasLlho_20XaBE.webp" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/_astro/chat.DPasLlho_Z27QqM.jpg" type="image/jpeg">  <img src="/_astro/chat.DPasLlho_Z1adj4s.png" alt="Chat interface showing workout sharing and messaging" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true" decoding="async" width="1510" height="1330"> </picture> </div> <div class="feature-card__content" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <h3 class="feature-card__title" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Chat</h3> <p class="feature-card__description" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Share workouts, activities, and screenshots with your team. Group messaging keeps coaches and athletes connected and on the same page.</p> <span class="feature-card__cta" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Learn more &rarr;</span> </div> </a><a href="/features/ask-a-coach/" class="feature-card" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <div class="feature-card__image" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <picture data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true"> <source srcset="/_astro/ask_a_coach.D6FIslP0_2qskRe.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="/_astro/ask_a_coach.D6FIslP0_Z1f2c3e.webp" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/_astro/ask_a_coach.D6FIslP0_O4iIA.jpg" type="image/jpeg">  <img src="/_astro/ask_a_coach.D6FIslP0_Z20SzYN.png" alt="Ask a coach interface showing coach and athlete interaction" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true" decoding="async" width="2304" height="1676"> </picture> </div> <div class="feature-card__content" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <h3 class="feature-card__title" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Ask A Coach</h3> <p class="feature-card__description" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Get coaching advice directly within Intervals.icu. Connect with professional coaches who can review your data and provide personalized guidance.</p> <span class="feature-card__cta" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Learn more &rarr;</span> </div> </a><a href="/features/athletes/" class="feature-card" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <div class="feature-card__image" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <picture data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true"> <source srcset="/_astro/athletes.Cyz4k65H_2vUxIT.avif" type="image/avif"><source srcset="/_astro/athletes.Cyz4k65H_Z2fPNye.webp" type="image/webp"><source srcset="/_astro/athletes.Cyz4k65H_Z29dA1j.jpg" type="image/jpeg">  <img src="/_astro/athletes.Cyz4k65H_2muaEo.png" alt="Athlete management view showing a list of coached athletes" loading="lazy" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz="true" decoding="async" width="1522" height="1002"> </picture> </div> <div class="feature-card__content" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz> <h3 class="feature-card__title" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Athletes</h3> <p class="feature-card__description" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Follow and coach athletes with easy-to-use athlete management. Tag and organize your athletes for efficient coaching workflows.</p> <span class="feature-card__cta" data-astro-cid-lxmfzltz>Learn more &rarr;</span> </div> </a> </div> <a href="/features/communicate/" class="see-all" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
