 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>Free. Built by the Community.</h2> <p class="pricing-subtitle" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
Intervals.icu is free for everyone. Supporters help fund development and keep the platform independent.
</p> <div class="pricing-grid" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="pricing-card" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>  <h3 class="pricing-card__name" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Free</h3> <div class="pricing-card__price" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd> <span class="price-amount" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>$0</span> <span class="price-period" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>forever</span> </div> <p class="pricing-card__description" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Powerful training tools at no cost. No credit card required.</p> <ul class="pricing-card__features" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd> <li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Fitness, fatigue &amp; form tracking</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Activity analysis &amp; interval detection</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Training calendar &amp; workout builder</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Power curve &amp; HR analytics</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Multisport support</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Device &amp; platform integrations</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Custom charts</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Many more features</li> </ul> <a href="https://intervals.icu/signup" rel="nofollow" class="pricing-card__cta" data-umami-event="signup-cta-click" data-umami-event-source="pricing-card-free" data-umami-event-page="/" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Get Started Free</a> </div> <div class="pricing-card pricing-card--highlighted" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd> <div class="pricing-card__badge" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Popular</div> <h3 class="pricing-card__name" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Supporter</h3> <div class="pricing-card__price" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd> <span class="price-amount" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>$4</span> <span class="price-period" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>/month</span> </div> <p class="pricing-card__description" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Unlock additional features and support ongoing development.</p> <ul class="pricing-card__features" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd> <li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Advanced weather analysis</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Annual training plan builder</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Import full Strava history</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Route matching, auto-flag commutes</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Customize activity summary</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Completely custom zones</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Upload CSV activity stream data</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Teams and coaching organisations</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Bulk configure athletes</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Early access to beta features</li><li data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Supporter feature requests move up the todo list!</li> </ul> <a href="https://intervals.icu/settings?action=subscribe" rel="nofollow" class="pricing-card__cta" data-umami-event="supporter-cta-click" data-umami-event-source="pricing-card-supporter" data-umami-event-page="/" data-astro-cid-5mb67dfd>Become a Supporter</a> </div> </div> <p class="pricing-note" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>
